  "prefLabel": "Env-Wr 505.02 Public Notice",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 505.02 Public Notice. If the local community(ies) request information relative to the EAP to be shared with the general public, the owner shall cooperate by participating in any informal meeting held by the local community(ies) at a location near the dam or the inundation area and by providing relevant information.\n\nSource. #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24 (formerly Env-Wr 506.02)",
